  bx('gr', "<b>Closing idea / pattern:</b> structural improvement followed <b>political convenience, not principle</b>; each reform triggered by <b>crisis</b> (1770 famine, 1857) or a <b>concession wrested by the Indian movement</b>; never Indianised beyond what was <b>economically necessary</b> (cost) or <b>politically unavoidable</b>; legacy = <b>codified law, organised civil service, hierarchical police</b>."),

