  t("<b>Codification</b> ('WRITTEN LAW')", "<b>1775</b>: <b>11 Pandits</b> compiled Hindu law; English translation = <b>Gentoo Code (1776)</b> ('Gentoo' from Portuguese 'Gentios', derogatory for Hindus: many Gods)", "<b>1778</b>: Islamic law: translated <b>Al-Hidayah</b> (Arabic manual) to Persian by Indian scholars, then English = <b>The Hedaya (1791)</b>", "<b>Code of 1781</b> (Hastings 73-85, Bengal only, issued by GG so later GG could change): <b>written orders compulsory</b> + rules for court functioning", w=24),
