  t("<b>Lee Commission 1923 (Royal Commission on Superior Civil Services)</b>", "Context: <b>Khilafat 1920-24, Non-Cooperation 1920-22</b>; equal British + Indian members; <b>report 1924</b>", "<b>20% Indians by promotion from PCS; 40% Indians by exam; 40% Europeans by exam</b> (total 100); <b>50:50 Indians:Europeans within 15 years</b> (exactly 50:50, not more); <b>PSC</b> (promised 1919) to be set up", "Structure: <b>AIS</b> (ICS, IPS, Indian Forest Service...), <b>Central Services</b> (Foreign Affairs, Customs, Railways...), <b>Provincial Services</b> (Health, Education...)", "Slide only: <b>PSC set up October 1926, Ross Barker first Chairman</b> (promised 1919, repeated 1923-24, set up 1926)", w=26),
