  bx('pk', "<b>Prelims 2017 (c) 2 and 3 only</b> " + P('2017') + ": Cornwallis 86-93 = PS 1793 in Bengal (zamindari, opposite system); <b>Alexander Read 1792 Baramahal</b> = early experiment; <b>Munro G(Ma) 1820-27</b> = mature Ryotwari. Hook: Read drafted, Munro delivered: Madras 1820; Cornwallis stayed in Bengal with Zamindars."),
